body": "Thank for your appeal! I'm very fond of your artwork, so I am thrilled to hear that you want to draw my character! Her name is Mel and she's a hardworking student who struggles with making friends, so please be kind to her!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/bIlEmGB", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@CqmZ40oxqgt6NSy/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9a046c2/uploads/origins/7c59f271-0aa5-4db5-92c0-ca884af74781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef18ec77e138c1cd0cbf83738b63c9d4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a9a046c2/uploads/origins/7c59f271-0aa5-4db5-92c0-ca884af74781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef18ec77e138c1cd0cbf83738b63c9d4, https://si.imgix.net/a9a046c2/uploads/origins/7c59f271-0aa5-4db5-92c0-ca884af74781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f2b5863d27d05df4190bfa114be4b0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a9a046c2/uploads/origins/7c59f271-0aa5-4db5-92c0-ca884af74781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=481fec21342c454ea091a7c85b3b869a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。この度、Vtuber Minoの絵を描いていただくことになりました。水彩画のような優しいイラストがとても好きです。今回は女性バージョンを描いていただけますか？ポーズや表情は問いませんし、衣装を変えて描いていただいても構いません。\n\n参考資料へのリンクはこちらです。https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N0MYbgzdpxe8wFCnPDTnq2DH0d7pHlpg?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N0MYbgzdpxe8wFCnPDTnq2DH0d7pHlpg?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@CqmZ40oxqgt6NSy/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/092eed8b/uploads/origins/fb8df2c6-cf70-4222-a738-c3d59832ab71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=280b2aaa31ed354d34105a10471f9791", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/092eed8b/uploads/origins/fb8df2c6-cf70-4222-a738-c3d59832ab71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=280b2aaa31ed354d341